# =============================================================================
# COMMON KNOWN-KEY DICTIONARY · MIFARE Classic · Proxmark3 format
# =============================================================================
# Well-known / factory-default keys, for cracking a stray default sector or a
# demo "factory" card. One 12-hex key per line; '#' = comment.
#
# Select this file when reading a MIFARE Classic card back (Module 2). A fresh
# magic/gen2 blank uses these common factory keys by default, so a read succeeds
# without setting any key. Mirrored in android/mct_common_keys.dic.
# =============================================================================

